cmd-rtscontrol-desc = Toggles admin RTS mode: select creatures with a box and order them to move.
cmd-rtscontrol-help = Usage: rtscontrol
    Ctrl+Left mouse (hold and drag) selects creatures, Ctrl+Right mouse orders them to move to the cursor, Ctrl+Alt+Right mouse on a creature orders them to attack it.
    Keys can be rebound in the controls menu.
cmd-rtscontrol-enabled = RTS mode enabled.
cmd-rtscontrol-disabled = RTS mode disabled.
cmd-rtscontrol-no-permission = You need the Fun admin flag to use RTS mode.
rts-control-invalid-target = RTS: invalid target point.
